    { q: "Do I need my WAEC or NECO result to register for JAMB?", a: "Not always at registration, because some candidates are still waiting for their O-level result. Your O-level details will be needed later in the admission process, so keep your result and examination number safe. Check the current JAMB guidance for what is needed at each stage." }
